{
  "number": 71,
  "title": "Add a legacy inventory fetcher and an inventory health probe",
  "body": "Adds app/legacy/fetch.py, which reads the legacy inventory service with up to 8 attempts because that service drops connections during its nightly restart, and app/health.py, which reads the inventory health endpoint with up to 3 attempts. Both raise an HTTP error response at once and retry other connection errors. Adds a sentence to docs/review-rules.md exempting modules under app/legacy/ from the retry cap. Tests cover success on the first attempt, success on the last attempt, an HTTP error, and exhaustion for both."
}
